@TheJukeBox_HostAddress = https://localhost:7077

### Landing page
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/html

### Player page
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/player
Accept: text/html

### Full audio library
### Returns a urn:jukebox:drive-consent-required problem (403) until Drive is connected.
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/audiofiles
Accept: application/json

### Library statistics
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/audiofiles/stats
Accept: application/json

### Search by file name
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/audiofiles/search?q=blue
Accept: application/json

### Audio inside one folder
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/audiofiles/folder/1BxiMVs0XRA5nFMdKvBdBZjgmUUqptlbs
Accept: application/json

### Query injection is rejected as 400 urn:jukebox:invalid-drive-identifier,
### rather than being escaped into the Drive query.
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/audiofiles/folder/' in parents or '1'='1
Accept: application/json

### Begin the OAuth flow
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/auth/setup
Accept: application/json

### Is a Drive grant present? (file check only, spends no Drive quota)
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/auth/status
Accept: application/json

### API reference (Development only)
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/scalar/v1
Accept: text/html

###
